                                                <TextBlock Text="Clipboard synchronization between devices uses direct peer-to-peer (LAN) pathways or secure, ephemeral Cloudflare relays. All network packets are encrypted with keys derived via PBKDF2-SHA256 (100,000 iterations)." FontSize="12.5" Foreground="{DynamicResource MicaWPF.Brushes.TextFillColorTertiary}" TextWrapping="Wrap" LineHeight="18"/>
